 trusty Cytron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/0c7315a27b22df583f61f84139b9bea7.avif?t=1755036187\" width=576 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/b3d69482d318294fd55fc8f2787300f4.avif?t=1755036187\" width=614 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the way of the Heroes by retrieving and retaining\u00a0<strong>Orbs</strong>, your  source of strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/366480fcff15464e54fd7007a349564a.poster.avif?t=1755036187\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/366480fcff15464e54fd7007a349564a.webm?t=1755036187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/366480fcff15464e54fd7007a349564a.mp4?t=1755036187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbs. Are. Everything! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Be mindful of your <strong>Orb Gauge</strong> <i>(Mana)</i> and <strong>Orb Vitality</strong> <i>(Health)</i>. Should your opponent deal damage to you, you'll lose Orbs from both your Orb Vitality <i>and</i> your Orb Gauge, robbing you of your very essence and your ability to use Magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also gain or lose Orbs depending on the public's perception of you, in a similar fashion to Karma, so don't go slicing too many light posts and trees in half!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve dropped Orbs and Orblettes to maintain vitality and, more importantly,  to unlock new <strong>Advances</strong> <i>(Skills)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/b21aff39e10515a6e45660eeecab71e4.poster.avif?t=1755036187\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/b21aff39e10515a6e45660eeecab71e4.webm?t=1755036187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431600/extras/b21aff39e10515a6e45660eeecab71e4.mp4?t=1755036187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between your arsenal, your crafting, and your abilities, you should be well-equipped for the world of battle that lies ahead, <i>hero</i>...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
